00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.750
I'm kidding!

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:19.280
She always went with her roommate,
 who would dress her.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.410
I see.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:23.270
